nse of jurisprudence, and at just seventeen, Cecil Sudo is the youngest Benmashi that Butterfly Law has ever employed. That means a lot of late nights burning the midnight brimstone, summoning up summaries, parsing phrases with paranormal paralegals and cutting deals with opposing counsels from hell.\n\nAnd when a young Benmashi starts to discover that her own charm may be more magically-based than she realized, there'll be a hex-tra incentive to work wonders outside the courtroom as well! Every trial is a witch trial as the most enchantingly Adept Attorney ever becomes a Master of the Art of Defensive Spells in Wizard Barristers!\n\n(Source: Sentai Filmworks)"},"tags":[{"name":"Magic","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Police","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Mopeds","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Wizard Barristers","english":"Wizard Barristers","native":"ウィザード・バリスターズ 弁魔士セシル","romaji":"Wizard Barristers: Benmashi Cecil","synonyms":[{"language":"ja","source":"bangumi","value":"ウィザード・バリスターズ〜弁魔士セシル"},{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"WIZARD BARRISTERS〜辩魔士圣知"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"WIZARD BARRISTERS〜弁魔士塞西尔"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"魔法辩护士圣知"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Wizard Barristers〜弁魔士赛希尔"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"wizard barristers〜弁魔士セシル"}]},"trailer":{"id":"Kxx2pnBKHes","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Kxx2pnBKHes/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}